    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109883" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕφος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφή</span>
			, <i>web,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				243
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				67.5
			</span></i> ( =
			<i><span class="en">
				84.4
			</span></i>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑμήν</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				10.1.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.396b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐριοῦν ὕ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.19
				</span></i>
			; of a spider, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.63
			</span></i>; of a <i>net,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.370
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Tib.
			</span></i> Ill.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῶν λόγων ὕ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					1.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Inv.</u>
				3.13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ποιήσεις οἷον ὕφη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Po.</u>
					5.11
				</span></i>
			; of the <i>text</i> of an author, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(1).80
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ φυσικὸν ὕ. τοῦ
			ἀριθμοῦ</span> the natural <i>series</i> of numbers, <i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Ar.</u>
				1.9
			</span></i>.</div>
